2026-07-27T14:32:01.1152812Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:32:01.1154302Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
